  greetingDialogueString:
  - I'll tell you something.
  greetingDialogueAudio:
  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 058554bb9a98f5f4a907d66a3884253a, type: 3}
  dialogueString:
  - There is meaning to your life. You are choosen to end the cycle and free this
    world.
  - With my help, I can weave that ether in your blood into strength and immunity
    to the guardian's ability to manipulate ether.
  - Follow your unescapable destiny and defeat all the guardian, only then will you
    be able to end the Great Reset.
  dialogueAudio:
